section(9,'Non-mutation finding','Captured ordinary before and after: `?? .ao-r3b/` only. Captured ignored before: `?? .ao-r3b/` only. Captured ignored after additionally names `!! .ao-r3b/bytecode/` and `!! .ao-r3b/packaging-copy/assets/icon-128.png`. No ignored src/tests/tools caches appeared because writes there were forbidden and redirected. `git diff --exit-code` exits 0 with empty output; staged changes are absent in porcelain. These are officer-created entries, not candidate mutations. No original packaging icon was generated.\n\nThe narrower no-tracked/no-new-untracked-non-ignored-candidate wording is consistent with this run. The default fresh-clone three-cache-directory half is INCONCLUSIVE, not falsely declared verified. It cannot be measured on this clone without violating the explicit write boundary. Scratch build directory outside the repo is the specifically requested output exception, not a candidate edit.')
